        "TileImage": "$($repository 46289843-9c67-445d-afa5-956ad7f2bb0f).Image",
        "Description": "Objective: neutralize the microchips carried by Chanthavong Chantara, Zach Cheng (both near the central pool) and Asmar El‑Radd. Chanthavong and Zach carry electrical‑resistant chips that must be destroyed with explosives. Asmar’s implant is vulnerable to electrocution and must be neutralized electrically. Heavy surveillance: cameras and guards with extended fields of view. You start with only the starter suit; the operation must be fast and stealthy. Good luck 47.",
